OfFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetSupportOfFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}support\\text{-}of\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetSupportOfFunction}_S(S,f,0)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X,Y\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land0\\in Y\\land S=\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq0\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set\\text{-}support\\text{-}of\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetSupportOfFunction}_S(S,f,0)\\leftrightarrow \\exists X,Y\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land0\\in Y\\land S=\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq0\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,f,0\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetSupportOfFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}